3
00:00:13.856 --> 00:00:17.205
<v Alex>Because an A I agent doesn't look at banner ads.

4
00:00:17.205 --> 00:00:20.249
<v Alex>It doesn't fall for extra add-ons at checkout.

5
00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:26.971
<v Maya>Greg Isenberg says big companies like Delta, Chase, and Amazon are blocking A I agents.

6
