7
00:00:29.418 --> 00:00:38.388
<v Maya>He also mapped out a nine-stage war over how the internet will fight back, adapt, and eventually optimize for machine buyers.

8
00:00:38.884 --> 00:00:52.870
<v Alex>Today we look at whether you should block A I agents or welcome them, why every A I model seems to have its own visual style, and how the Claude Code team turns repeated review notes into permanent rules.

